## Safety

- Corpus access is exclusively `open(path, "rb")` in `sha256_readonly()` — no write/move/delete anywhere in the scripts. Mac tree mtimes unchanged.
- No `CANONICAL` value can be stored (CHECK-rejected, and the smoke test proves the rejection).
- Plurality kept as `status` / `plurality_flags` / verbatim `inventory_status`; no catalogue merge logic; stdlib + `sqlite3` only.

